		(uuid "a1756373-013a-571a-9972-792f39c815fb")
	)
	(text "J1 -> host J2 by a 5-wire cable: GND, SDA, SCL, 3V3_SW to host J2.1-4, V12 to host J2.9\n(SENS2, analog; the host's 100 nF filter is fitted). On the board J1 reads in that order (D2, D4).\nNo I2C pull-ups here: the host's 4.7k on 3V3_SW are the bus's only ones.\nEverything on this board's logic side is powered from the host's 3V3_SW (D3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.71 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1d004c47-0115-5f59-a283-bbe758da713c")
	)
	(text "TCA9534 at 0x20 (A0-A2 low), on the host's 3V3_SW: with the host's sensor rail off it is unpowered\nand the 100k pull-downs hold every valve off, as they do while its pins are inputs (D3).\nP0-P7 high = valve 1-8 on. Valves 5-8 may be left unfitted.\nValves: 12 V DC, low-side switched, up to ~2 A each; ~3 A in total, set by F1.\nNot for latching valves or 24 V AC valves.\nFLYBACK: each diode returns to the same +12V as its valve's V+ pin, after D1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120.65 313.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2d2e87e9-63e5-54d1-ac00-13d3fe286b92")
	)
	(text "12 V INPUT & PROTECTION, 12 V SENSE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.0232 68.2937 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4d47b63f-4a6a-54c8-acb0-b3711107a848")
	)
	(text "F1 (3 A hold, 16 V) trips on a shorted cable; D1 (SS54, 5 A) blocks reverse polarity;\nD2 (SMAJ15A) clamps surges. 15 V max. As the irrigation board (its D77).\nV12_SENSE = 12 V x 100k/660k: 2.27 V at 15 V. ~18 uA from the battery, always (D4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a37fc792-c35c-55e9-aca5-8c811306d7f6")
	)
	(text "I2C EXPANDER & VALVE DRIVERS (LOW-SIDE MOSFET PER VALVE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.2571 147.195 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a4d6d7dd-8b92-576e-b296-973bdd3d4ec7")
	)
	(text "TO THE HOST BOARD (SENSOR / LORA J2) & OLED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.63 68.455 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fb777606-dcb6-5fab-af8d-80918a3c4d95")
	)
